<title>USA: Metropolitan Health completes IPO.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Health completes IPO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Health Networks Inc said on Monday that it completed its initial public offering of 825,000 shares of common stock at $6.00 per share, and generated net proceeds before expenses of $4,677,750.</p>
<p>The issue also consisted of 1,650,000 warrants at $0.15 per warrant, in which each warrant would be exercisable to buy one share of common stock at $7.00 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
